      "message": "I originally thought that create the baseMonitorClass and make ThreadLeakMonitor and DefaultNetworkRestoreMonitor to extend baseMonitorClass.\nSomething like the following.\n```\nfun createMonitors() {\n   ....\n}\n\noverride fun run(notifier: RunNotifier) {\n  val monitors \u003d createMonitors()\n  \n  for (monitor: monitors) {\n      monitor.init();\n  }\n  run()\n  for (monitor: monitors) {\n      monitor.reportResult();\n  }  \n}\n\n```\nBut we only have two monitors currently and I\u0027m not sure if this abstraction works for monitors we might add in the future.\nSo I haven\u0027t done this in this CL.\nI\u0027m not sure if I want to do this in this CL, but I can do if you prefer.",
